        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15278\">issue #15278</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This input:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"clif\"><pre><span></span><code>test inline\ntarget x86_64\n\nfunction %poll_callee(i64, i64, i64) -&gt; i64 tail {\nblock0(v0: i64, v1: i64, v2: i64):\n    v4 = interrupt_poll v1, v2, user3\n    return v4\n}\n\nfunction %poll_caller(i64, i64, i64) -&gt; i64 system_v {\n    fn0 = %poll_callee(i64, i64, i64) -&gt; i64 tail\nblock0(v0: i64, v1: i64, v2: i64):\n    v4 = call fn0(v0, v1, v2)\n    return v4\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">clif</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">util</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clif</span>\n<span class=\"n\">FAIL</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inline</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clif</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">inline</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Caused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">CLIF</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">verification</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inlining</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">inst2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v6</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interrupt_poll</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">user3</span><span class=\"p\">):</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">`</span><span class=\"n\">interrupt_poll</span><span class=\"err\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">requires</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">`</span><span class=\"n\">tail</span><span class=\"err\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">calling</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">convention</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</blockquote>",
